  "text": "## Technology Stack\n\nAVENIQ utilizes proven open-source containerization frameworks, DevOps tools, and cloud platforms:\n\n- **Containerization**: Docker, Docker Compose\n- **CI/CD Automation**: GitHub Actions, Webhooks\n- **Web Server & Reverse Proxy**: Nginx, Caddy\n- **Security & CDN Network**: Cloudflare (DNS, SSL, WAF, CDN)\n- **Operating Systems**: Linux (Ubuntu Server, Debian)\n- **Monitoring & Alerting**: Uptime Kuma, Prometheus, Grafana, Telegram/Slack Webhooks\n\n---",
